            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_yUC4A3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NADCO offers a full selection of products and solutions for our customers in the aerospace industry. When you choose NADCO, you benefit from superior-quality products, short lead times, and extensive custom manufacturing capabilities. We are dedicated to providing exceptional customer service and consistent products that meet or exceed even the most stringent customer specifications and industry standards.</p><p>With NADCO, you gain reliability, durability, and excellent performance from your aerospace tapes. Choosing a reliable tape supplier that has aerospace experience ensures that you have the perfect adhesive tapes for your aerospace applications while meeting the industry’s extremely stringent regulatory standards.</p><p>The NADCO team is committed to providing superior tapes and other adhesive solutions. To learn more about our custom manufacturing capabilities for the aerospace industry, <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\">contact the experts at NADCO</a> today.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
